source: Cruz-Jentoft AJ, Bahat G, Bauer J, et al. Sarcopenia: revised European consensus on definition and diagnosis (EWGSOP2). Age Ageing 2019;48(1):16-31. || sarcopenia revised European consensus definition diagnosis EWGSOP2
source: Fragala MS, Cadore EL, Dorgo S, et al. Resistance training for older adults: position statement from the National Strength and Conditioning Association. J Strength Cond Res 2019;33(8):2019-2052. || resistance training older adults position statement NSCA 2019
source: Dent E, Morley JE, Cruz-Jentoft AJ, et al. International Clinical Practice Guidelines for Sarcopenia (ICFSR): screening, diagnosis and management. J Nutr Health Aging 2018;22(10):1148-1161. || international clinical practice guidelines sarcopenia ICFSR screening diagnosis management
